    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2005870/extras/7d14c702c97b85640cde9c8e2e805e75.poster.avif?t=1754246026\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2005870/extras/7d14c702c97b85640cde9c8e2e805e75.webm?t=1754246026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2005870/extras/7d14c702c97b85640cde9c8e2e805e75.mp4?t=1754246026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>House of Necrosis</strong> is a turn-based horror RPG, inspired by the early 3D Survival Horror games of the 90s. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A special forces team went missing while investigating bizarre murder cases in an old mansion near the forest. You were sent to discover why. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2005870/extras/5a42cec8bc6f5247fa9c824b53520840.poster.avif?t=1754246026\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2005870/extras/5a42cec8bc6f5247fa9c824b53520840.webm?t=1754246026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2005870/extras/5a42cec8bc6f5247fa9c824b53520840.mp4?t=1754246026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>[A HORRIFYING RPG]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Level up your character and upgrade your weapons while making your way through a house of horror. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2005870/extras/51347760912f58e7027a04a5aabdf66f.poster.avif?t=1754246026\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2005870/extras/51347760912f58e7027a04a5aabdf66f.webm?t=1754246026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2005870/extras/51347760912f58e7027a04a5aabdf66f.mp4?t=1754246026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>[MYSTERIOUS DUNGEONS]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wander through the endless halls of the mansion that change every time you enter. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2005870/extras/10e9b9f59c0a2a42f8d1812c04906307.poster.avif?t=1754246026\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2005870/extras/10e9b9f59c0a2a42f8d1812c04906307.webm?t=1754246026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2005870/extras/10e9b9f59c0a2a42f8d1812c04906307.mp4?t=1754246026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>[JUST LIKE BACK IN THE DAY]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by the 32-bit classics, House of Necrosis looks and feels like your favorite 90s games.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2005870/extras/7d14c702c97b85640cde9c8e2e805e75.poster.avif?t=1754246026\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2005870/extras/7d14c702c97b85640cde9c8e2e805e75.webm?t=1754246026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2005870/extras/7d14c702c97b85640cde9c8e2e805e75.mp4?t=1754246026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>House of Necrosis</strong> is a turn-based horror RPG, inspired by the early 3D Survival Horror games of the 90s. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A special forces team went missing while investigating bizarre murder cases in an old mansion near the forest. You were sent to discover why. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2005870/extras/5a42cec8bc6f5247fa9c824b53520840.poster.avif?t=1754246026\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2005870/extras/5a42cec8bc6f5247fa9c824b53520840.webm?t=1754246026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2005870/extras/5a42cec8bc6f5247fa9c824b53520840.mp4?t=1754246026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>[A HORRIFYING RPG]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Level up your character and upgrade your weapons while making your way through a house of horror. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2005870/extras/51347760912f58e7027a04a5aabdf66f.poster.avif?t=1754246026\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2005870/extras/51347760912f58e7027a04a5aabdf66f.webm?t=1754246026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2005870/extras/51347760912f58e7027a04a5aabdf66f.mp4?t=1754246026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>[MYSTERIOUS DUNGEONS]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wander through the endless halls of the mansion that change every time you enter. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2005870/extras/10e9b9f59c0a2a42f8d1812c04906307.poster.avif?t=1754246026\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2005870/extras/10e9b9f59c0a2a42f8d1812c04906307.webm?t=1754246026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2005870/extras/10e9b9f59c0a2a42f8d1812c04906307.mp4?t=1754246026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>[JUST LIKE BACK IN THE DAY]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by the 32-bit classics, House of Necrosis looks and feels like your favorite 90s games.</p>",
